# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & environment — NEVER commit real values
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore every .env variant (these hold JWT_SECRET, SSH_CRED_ENCRYPTION_KEY
# (the vault KEK), DATABASE_URL with the DB password, SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD,
# GEMINI_API_KEY, etc.) but keep the placeholder template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env

# Credential material / certs / keys of any kind
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.p12
*.pfx
*.der
*.keystore
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*.ppk
*.gpg
*.asc
*.pgp
secrets/
secret/
*.secret
*-secrets.*
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*.kek

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internal / operational notes (infra topology, public IP, admin email, etc.)
# Not application code — keep out of a public repo.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
memory.md
MEMORY.md
NOTES.md
*.local.md
deepconsol_build_prompt.md
*_build_prompt.md

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Logs (build*.log may echo env values during a build)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dependencies & build output
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.turbo/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime data / object storage (uploaded docs, embeddings, uploads)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/var/
storage/
uploads/
docs-store/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / editor cruft
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
